flowchart TB
 E[EOS and structure] --> C[Heat capacity and emissivity]
 G[Channel gap profile] --> C
 C --> T[Redshift aware cooling]
 A[Atmosphere and age data] --> L[Thermal likelihood]
 T --> L
 I[Inertia and entrainment] --> R[Two reservoir torque emulator]
 R --> Y[Timing likelihood]
 O[Barycentric timing records] --> Y
 L --> S[Shared nuisance sampler]
 Y --> S
 S --> P[Temperature and lag predictions]
